" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-79c26d0c></div><div class="client-reference__logo" data-v-79c26d0c><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjQd_IqRLdaBguP_Feel.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjQd_IqRLdaBguP_Feel.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjQd_IqRLdaBguP_Feel.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjQd_IqRLdaBguP_Feel.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-79c26d0c></div><!--]--></div></div></div><section id="article_link_module" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3ColumnWithoutLinks" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--v-if--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--v-if--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7Nygp7c43Q3f4HG_DJI_003462e2.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7Nygp7c43Q3f4HG_DJI_0034.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C255%2C6000%2C3990&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7Nygp7c43Q3f4HG_DJI_0034.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C255%2C6000%2C3990&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7Nygp7c43Q3f4HG_DJI_0034.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C255%2C6000%2C3990&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A drone shot of an Evri hub. There are rows of Evri trucks and vans of various sizes stationed at the units across the hub ready to take on parcels. " width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->One partner, end to end ​<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Your one stop shop logistics solution, offering some of the latest order cut offs and cheapest shipping rates in the industry.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices524d.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C6016%2C4001&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C6016%2C4001&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C6016%2C4001&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A side profile view shows an Evri branded lorry is driving along a straight road with an aeroplane that can be seen closely above." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Global reach &amp; operations​<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With warehouses in the UK, US, EU and Middle East, our parcel network delivers to 220+ countries and territories across the globe. We support eCommerce, B2B and retail clients and we&#39;re Amazon Prime accredited. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R3c5bqstJ9-SQr_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8406bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R3c5bqstJ9-SQr_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8406.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R3c5bqstJ9-SQr_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8406.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R3c5bqstJ9-SQr_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8406.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Business owner sat at a desk in their home office taking a phone call and using their laptop to book multiple parcels" width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Control, visibility &amp; support              ​<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With 80+ seamless integrations, you&#39;ll gain access an inventory portal with real time tracking, custom dashboards and more. Choose Evri for an intelligent cloud based platform. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="4" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-90dc4169><div id="cutting-edge-facilities-across-the-globe" class="photo-list__text-container" data-v-90dc4169><h2 class="photo-list__title" data-v-90dc4169>Cutting edge facilities across the globe</h2><p class="photo-list__desc" data-v-90dc4169>Our worldwide hub network represents constant investment in industry leading technology, scalability, and quality of service. Check out our top locations to see where you could be storing your products:</p></div><!--[--><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjnOfIqRLdaBhN0_Basildon-evri-logoa942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjnOfIqRLdaBhN0_Basildon-evri-logo.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjnOfIqRLdaBhN0_Basildon-evri-logo.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjnOfIqRLdaBhN0_Basildon-evri-logo.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><!----> UK</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri’s Basildon fulfilment centre spans 85,000 Sq. ft and operates 24/7 to support fast, flexible order processing. ​Strategically located in the UK, the site is designed to handle high volumes efficiently, ensuring quick turnaround times and reliable service for eCommerce, retail, and B2B businesses.​ <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/explore-our-global-fulfilment-centres" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->More information<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjnOPIqRLdaBhNz_USAhubevrilogo6b6b.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjnOPIqRLdaBhNz_USAhubevrilogo.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C44%2C1024%2C681&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjnOPIqRLdaBhNz_USAhubevrilogo.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C44%2C1024%2C681&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjnOPIqRLdaBhNz_USAhubevrilogo.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C44%2C1024%2C681&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><!----> EU</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri’s Netherlands fulfilment centre is located in Vianen, offering 70,000 sq ft of modern warehousing space in the heart of Europe. ​Strategically positioned for fast access to key EU markets, the site enables efficient cross-border shipping, EU-wide distribution, and local fulfilment for eCommerce, retail, and B2B businesses.​ <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/explore-our-global-fulfilment-centres" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->More information<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjnN_IqRLdaBhNy_eh-warehouse-outside-evri-logob34b.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjnN_IqRLdaBhNy_eh-warehouse-outside-evri-logo.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C1039%2C691&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjnN_IqRLdaBhNy_eh-warehouse-outside-evri-logo.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C1039%2C691&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aAjnN_IqRLdaBhNy_eh-warehouse-outside-evri-logo.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C1039%2C691&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><!----> USA</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri’s U.S. fulfilment center is strategically located in the East Coast close to major ports, spanning over 130,000 sq. ft. and is purpose-built to support scalable, high-volume operations. ​With over 15,000 pallet locations, the site enables flexible, reliable, and efficient order processing for eCommerce, retail, and B2B clients across North America.​ <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/explore-our-global-fulfilment-centres" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->More information<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uM0JbqstJ9-DCa_Barnsley-Interior-01811a.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uM0JbqstJ9-DCa_Barnsley-Interior-01.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C6000%2C3990&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uM0JbqstJ9-DCa_Barnsley-Interior-01.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C6000%2C3990&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5uM0JbqstJ9-DCa_Barnsley-Interior-01.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C6000%2C3990&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Evri&#39;s Barnsley hub interior, displaying vast rows of parcel sorters and conveyors" width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><!----> Middle East</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The Oman warehouse is a modern fulfilment centre with over 13,000 sq ft of dedicated space and total capacity exceeding 37,000 sq ft. Equipped with ambient storage, flexible racking, and a full fulfilment management system, it offers secure inventory storage, accurate picking and packing, and shipping to domestic and international destinations. ​Strategically located with airside access to Muscat International Airport, it enables fast inspection, clearance, and delivery across the region.​ <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/explore-our-global-fulfilment-centres" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->More information<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="5" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="5-great-reasons-to-use-evri-fulfilment" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>5 great reasons to use Evri Fulfilment</h2><!----></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" d