7a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x0ZbqstJ9-pVE_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1597.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x0ZbqstJ9-pVE_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1597.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x0ZbqstJ9-pVE_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1597.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri courier is walking down a street of terraced houses carrying a parcel. The greenery and architecture suggests a rural British town or village." width="7610" height="5076" class="landing-feature-banner__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Deliver your products with the UK&#39;s largest dedicated shipping company</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our 20,000+ dedicated local couriers delivered over 800 million parcels in 2024, setting a new record for Evri, and we have no plans to slow down. Our extensive size and scale enable us to be flexible with your volumes, ensuring we can accommodate businesses of any size.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Did we mention that we also have some of the latest cut-off times in the industry, all whilst maintaining a 99% on-time Standard Delivery service? Experience unparalleled customer satisfaction with Evri global fulfilment.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__button-wrapper" data-v-54256dfc><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-3 e-button