"subpath1":11,"subpath2":13,"slices":14},"Global Fulfilment With a Trusted Courier Service | Evri","Grow your business with the UK's largest dedicated parcel delivery company by choosing Evri global fulfilment for your products. Get in touch today.","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffulfilment-services",{"link_type":12},"Document",{"link_type":12},[15,49,70,125,181,262,329,352,428,465,510,551],{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":18,"primary":19,"id":47,"slice_type":48,"slice_label":20},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[],{"theme":20,"PageHeaderTitle":21,"PageHeaderText":22,"PageHeaderCtaText":28,"PageHeaderCtaUrl":29,"secondaryCtaText":20,"secondaryCtaLabel":20,"secondaryCtaUrl":33,"PageHeaderImage":35,"heroImage":45,"videoContent":46,"showPremiumLogo":20},null,"Global fulfilment with a trusted courier service",[23],{"type":24,"text":25,"spans":26,"direction":27},"paragraph","Grow your business with the UK's largest dedicated parcel delivery company by choosing Evri fulfilment for your products. ",[],"ltr","Speak to an expert",{"link_type":30,"key":31,"url":32},"Web","70c07d9c-bcbd-4fd2-9a32-eea08f5c7324","\u002Ffulfilment-form",{"link_type":34},"Any",{"dimensions":36,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":39,"id":40,"edit":41},{"width":37,"height":38},1579,190,"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAi3tPIqRLdaBgMO_fulfilment-monotype.svg","aAi3tPIqRLdaBgMO",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},0,1,"transparent",{},{"link_type":12},"page_header$96e47fbc-8b5d-45b0-9b16-5bead705621d","page_header",{"variation":50,"version":17,"items":51,"primary":52,"id":68,"slice_type":69,"slice_label":20},"default",[],{"type":53,"title":54,"bodyText":55,"vimeoUrl":56,"videoTitle":59,"videoCover":60},"fullWidth","Discover a smarter fulfilment service with Evri","When looking for a fulfilment partner to suit your needs, a single tech-driven solution that carries your product end-to-end is essential for seamless operations and customer satisfaction. Evri can support your business in managing rising customer expectations, peak period demand, cost pressures, and scalability. Check out this quick video for some quick insight on the value we're providing to our partners.",{"link_type":30,"key":57,"url":58},"f9dc7c2f-8e8a-4bd9-9992-504afa988bab","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fplayer.vimeo.com\u002Fvideo\u002F1062465087?h=42307ca891&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479","Evri Fulfilment Service",{"dimensions":61,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":64,"id":65,"edit":66},{"width":62,"height":63},1000,665,"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjS0PIqRLdaBgzK_Evri-fulfilment-video-thumbnail.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=202%2C0%2C1233%2C820&w=1000&h=665","aAjS0PIqRLdaBgzK",{"x":67,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},202,"video_banner$f5f04b09-5ffe-484e-9a33-f1992f6d0032","video_banner",{"variation":50,"version":17,"items":71,"primary":121,"id":123,"slice_type":124,"slice_label":20},[72,79,85,91,97,103,109,115],{"src":73},{"dimensions":74,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":76,"id":77,"edit":78},{"width":75,"height":75},500,"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjQZPIqRLdaBguH_Fairy-loot.svg","aAjQZPIqRLdaBguH",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"src":80},{"dimensions":81,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":82,"id":83,"edit":84},{"width":75,"height":75},"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjQbfIqRLdaBguL_doro-ab.svg","aAjQbfIqRLdaBguL",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"src":86},{"dimensions":87,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":88,"id":89,"edit":90},{"width":75,"height":75},"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjQefIqRLdaBguS_KBF-Enterprises.svg","aAjQefIqRLdaBguS",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"src":92},{"dimensions":93,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":94,"id":95,"edit":96},{"width":75,"height":75},"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjQfPIqRLdaBguU_Morris.svg","aAjQfPIqRLdaBguU",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"src":98},{"dimensions":99,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":100,"id":101,"edit":102},{"width":75,"height":75},"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjQfvIqRLdaBguW_nano-beauty.svg","aAjQfvIqRLdaBguW",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"src":104},{"dimensions":105,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":106,"id":107,"edit":108},{"width":75,"height":75},"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjQgPIqRLdaBguX_verisure.svg","aAjQgPIqRLdaBguX",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"src":110},{"dimensions":111,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":112,"id":113,"edit":114},{"width":75,"height":75},"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjQg_IqRLdaBguZ_wow-hydrate.svg","aAjQg_IqRLdaBguZ",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"src":116},{"dimensions":117,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":118,"id":119,"edit":120},{"width":75,"height":75},"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjQd_IqRLdaBguP_Feel.svg","aAjQd_IqRLdaBguP",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"heading":122},"Small business to large enterprise, we're here to support your fulfilment needs","client_reference_strip$e84d4638-e831-4011-88b7-6dcb3e67a847","client_reference_strip",{"variation":126,"version":17,"items":127,"primary":176,"id":179,"slice_type":180,"slice_label":20},"3ColumnWithoutLinks",[128,145,161],{"Title":129,"Description":134,"Image":138,"Label":20},[130],{"type":131,"text":132,"spans":133,"direction":27},"heading3","One partner, end to end ​",[],[135],{"type":24,"text":136,"spans":137,"direction":27},"Your one stop shop logistics solution, offering some of the latest order cut offs and cheapest shipping rates in the industry.",[],{"dimensions":139,"alt":140,"copyright":20,"url":141,"id":142,"edit":143},{"width":62,"height":63},"A drone shot of an Evri hub. There are rows of Evri trucks and vans of various sizes stationed at the units across the hub ready to take on parcels. ","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7Nygp7c43Q3f4HG_DJI_0034.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C255%2C6000%2C3990&w=1000&h=665","Z7Nygp7c43Q3f4HG",{"x":42,"y":144,"zoom":43,"background":44},255,{"Title":146,"Description":150,"Image":154,"Label":20},[147],{"type":131,"text":148,"spans":149,"direction":27},"Global reach & operations​",[],[151],{"type":24,"text":152,"spans":153,"direction":27},"With warehouses in the UK, US, EU and Middle East, our parcel network delivers to 220+ countries and territories across the globe. We support eCommerce, B2B and retail clients and we're Amazon Prime accredited. ",[],{"dimensions":155,"alt":156,"copyright":20,"url":157,"id":158,"edit":159},{"width":62,"height":63},"A side profile view shows an Evri branded lorry is driving along a straight road with an aeroplane that can be seen closely above.","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C6016%2C4001&w=1000&h=665","Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap",{"x":42,"y":160,"zoom":43,"background":44},8,{"Title":162,"Description":166,"Image":170,"Label":20},[163],{"type":131,"text":164,"spans":165,"direction":27},"Control, visibility & support              ​",[],[167],{"type":24,"text":168,"spans":169,"direction":27},"With 80+ seamless integrations, you'll gain access an inventory portal with real time tracking, custom dashboards and more. Choose Evri for an intelligent cloud based platform. ",[],{"dimensions":171,"alt":172,"copyright":20,"url":173,"id":174,"edit":175},{"width":62,"height":63},"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office taking a phone call and using their laptop to book multiple parcels","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R3c5bqstJ9-SQr_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8406.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R3c5bqstJ9-SQr",{"x":42,"y":160,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"SectionTitle":177,"SectionDescription":178,"theme":20},[],[],"article_link_module$c296a235-0db5-4535-9529-1ef0a20417a3","article_link_module",{"variation":182,"version":17,"items":183,"primary":256,"id":260,"slice_type":261,"slice_label":20},"photoListComponent",[184,205,222,238],{"title":185,"content":186,"isNumbered":199,"image":200},"UK",[187],{"type":24,"text":188,"spans":189,"direction":27},"Evri’s Basildon fulfilment centre spans 85,000 Sq. ft and operates 24\u002F7 to support fast, flexible order processing. ​Strategically located in the UK, the site is designed to handle high volumes efficiently, ensuring quick turnaround times and reliable service for eCommerce, retail, and B2B businesses.​ More information",[190,197],{"start":191,"end":192,"type":193,"data":194},304,320,"hyperlink",{"link_type":30,"url":195,"target":196},"\u002Fexplore-our-global-fulfilment-centres","_self",{"start":191,"end":192,"type":198},"strong",false,{"dimensions":201,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":202,"id":203,"edit":204},{"width":62,"height":63},"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjnOfIqRLdaBhN0_Basildon-evri-logo.png?auto=format,compress","aAjnOfIqRLdaBhN0",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"title":206,"content":207,"isNumbered":199,"image":216},"EU",[208],{"type":24,"text":209,"spans":210,"direction":27},"Evri’s Netherlands fulfilment centre is located in Vianen, offering 70,000 sq ft of modern warehousing space in the heart of Europe. ​Strategically positioned for fast access to key EU markets, the site enables efficient cross-border shipping, EU-wide distribution, and local fulfilment for eCommerce, retail, and B2B businesses.​ More information",[211,215],{"start":212,"end":213,"type":193,"data":214},331,347,{"link_type":30,"url":195,"target":196},{"start":212,"end":213,"type":198},{"dimensions":217,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":218,"id":219,"edit":220},{"width":62,"height":63},"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjnOPIqRLdaBhNz_USAhubevrilogo.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C44%2C1024%2C681&w=1000&h=665","aAjnOPIqRLdaBhNz",{"x":42,"y":221,"zoom":43,"background":44},44,{"title":223,"content":224,"isNumbered":199,"image":233},"USA",[225],{"type":24,"text":226,"spans":227,"direction":27},"Evri’s U.S. fulfilment center is strategically located in the East Coast close to major ports, spanning over 130,000 sq. ft. and is purpose-built to support scalable, high-volume operations. ​With over 15,000 pallet locations, the site enables flexible, reliable, and efficient order processing for eCommerce, retail, and B2B clients across North America.​ More information",[228,232],{"start":229,"end":230,"type":193,"data":231},357,373,{"link_type":30,"url":195,"target":196},{"start":229,"end":230,"type":198},{"dimensions":234,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":235,"id":236,"edit":237},{"width":62,"height":63},"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaAjnN_IqRLdaBhNy_eh-warehouse-outside-evri-logo.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C1039%2C691&w=1000&h=665","aAjnN_IqRLdaBhNy",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"title":239,"content":240,"isNumbered":199,"image":249},"Middle East",[241],{"type":24,"text":242,"spans":243,"direction":27},"The Oman warehouse is a modern fulfilment centre with over 13,000 sq ft of dedicated space and total capacity exceeding 37,000 sq ft. Equipped with ambient storage, flexible racking, and a full fulfilment management system, it offers secure inventory storage, accurate picking and packing, and shipping to domestic and international destinations. ​Strategically located with airside access to Muscat International Airport, it enables fast inspection, clearance, and delivery across the region.​ More information",[244,248],{"start":245,"end":246,"type":193,"data":247},495,511,{"link_type":30,"url":195,"target":196},{"start":245,"end":246,"type":198},{"dimensions":250,"alt":251,"copyright":20,"url":252,"id":253,"edit":254},{"width":62,"height":63},"Evri's Barnsley hub interior, displaying vast rows of parcel sorters and conveyors","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ5uM0JbqstJ9-DCa_Barnsley-Interior-01.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C5%2C6000%2C3990&w=1000&h=665","Z5uM0JbqstJ9-DCa",{"x":42,"y":255,"zoom":43,"background":44},5,{"theme":257,"title":258,"description":259},"standard","Cutting edge facilities across the globe","Our worldwide hub network represents constant investment in industry leading technology, scalability, and quality of service. Check out our top locations to see where you could be storing your products:","list_block$0223007f-df60-4f77-b76e-f63b672e222a","list_block",{"variation":263,"version":17,"items":264,"primary":326,"id":328,"slice_type":261,"slice_label":20},"listComponent",[265,278,290,302,314],{"title":266,"content":267,"icon":271},"Regain control of your fulfilment",[268],{"type":24,"text":269,"spans":270,"direction":27},"Full visibility and flexibility to scale on your terms",[],{"dimensions":272,"alt":274,"copyright":20,"url":275,"id":276,"edit":277},{"width":273,"height":273},40,"Lightbulb icon","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9028d913-9c89-4f01-b423-3fd1d160c4a1_lightbulb.svg","Yh96FRIAACoA-Zru",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"title":279,"content":280,"icon":284},"Up to 10pm cut-off time",[281],{"type":24,"text":282,"spans":283,"direction":27},"Offer late ordering and still get fast delivery",[],{"dimensions":285,"alt":286,"copyright":20,"url":287,"id":288,"edit":289},{"width":273,"height":273},"Icon of a clock","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F40f1b5ea-7a5c-44d7-8e16-86d427c88a1d_its_too_late1.svg","Yh96GBIAACoA-Zsp",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"title":291,"content":292,"icon":296},"Same-day dispatch, 7 days a week",[293],{"type":24,"text":294,"spans":295,"direction":27},"Keep customers happy with consistently quick turnaround ",[],{"dimensions":297,"alt":298,"copyright":20,"url":299,"id":300,"edit":301},{"width":273,"height":273},"Icon of a courier","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff67d24e2-931f-4df2-b583-2c51af7d6cf4_courier3.svg","Yh96FhIAACkA-Zr4",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"title":303,"content":304,"icon":308},"Cut costs with combined shipping and fulfilment",[305],{"type":24,"text":306,"spans":307,"direction":27},"Reduce operational spend with an all-in-one solution",[],{"dimensions":309,"alt":310,"copyright":20,"url":311,"id":312,"edit":313},{"width":273,"height":273},"Lorry icon","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0b4ebd07-2b68-4949-b6d0-18745f26e60b_lorry.svg","Yh96FxIAACoA-ZsY",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"title":315,"content":316,"icon":320},"Global omnichannel fulfilment for fast-scaling brands",[317],{"type":24,"text":318,"spans":319,"direction":27},"Seamless fulfilment across every channel as you grow",[],{"dimensions":321,"alt":322,"copyright":20,"url":323,"id":324,"edit":325},{"width":273,"height":273},"Above and beyond icon","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41bf8079-3dd8-48b6-ad6b-013e68421339_above_and_beyond.svg","YflBvREAACIA8pXG",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"theme":257,"title":327,"description":20},"5 great reasons to use Evri Fulfilment","list_block$56d6c2eb-9818-4262-bcfb-618902931c40",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":330,"primary":331,"id":350,"slice_type":351,"slice_label":20},[],{"CardImage":332,"CardAvatar":338,"CardTitle":339,"CardText":340,"ButtonText":347,"ButtonUrl":348,"IsEco":199},{"dimensions":333,"alt":334,"copyright":20,"url":335,"id":336,"edit":337},{"width":62,"height":63},"A woman is sat at home at her desk smiling looking at her laptop screen","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7819.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zdBZbqstJ9-inZ",{"x":42,"y":160,"zoom":43,"background":44},"none","Seamless integrations for smarter fulfilment",[341,344],{"type":24,"text":342,"spans":343,"direction":27},"Integrate your tools for an order turnaround without delay. Our API and automation software ensures accuracy, reliability, and scalability across over 80 different platforms. ",[],{"type":24,"text":345,"spans":346,"direction":27},"Enjoy the benefits of technology driven fulfilment with real time tracking, intuitive inventory management, customisable dashboards for live data insight and much more.",[],"Get started",{"link_type":30,"key":349,"url":32},"12f874c8-7da7-4aad-b433-1832b368cf58","card$a36e6089-ecc4-480b-80da-368e25e1fb58","card",{"variation":353,"version":17,"items":354,"primary":422,"id":426,"slice_type":427,"slice_label":20},"fullList",[355,365,373,382,390,398,406,414],{"integrationLogo":356,"integrationDescription":20},{"dimensions":357,"alt":360,"copyright":20,"url":361,"id":362,"edit":363},{"width":358,"height":359},192,59,"amazon logo","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0d3404f1-1148-4031-9a71-21edd00d425e_amazon.svg","YiZguBIAACwAGJi1",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":364},"#fff",{"integrationLogo":366,"integrationDescription":20},{"dimensions":367,"alt":369,"copyright":20,"url":370,"id":371,"edit":372},{"width":358,"height":368},56,"shopify logo","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2eb19988-4ddd-43d4-bbdd-97d62a681cad_shopify.svg","YiZguBIAAC4AGJi2",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":364},{"integrationLogo":374,"integrationDescription":20},{"dimensions":375,"alt":378,"copyright":20,"url":379,"id":380,"edit":381},{"width":376,"height":377},191,77,"ebay logo ","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F18d949e5-c18f-43ae-bfb2-9870c726c177_ebay.svg","YiZguBIAACkAGJi3",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":364},{"integrationLogo":383,"integrationDescription":20},{"dimensions":384,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":387,"id":388,"edit":389},{"width":385,"height":386},1024,247,"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ9hl3DiBA97GikM8_Temu_logo.svg.webp?auto=format,compress","Z9hl3DiBA97GikM8",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"integrationLogo":391,"integrationDescription":20},{"dimensions":392,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":395,"id":396,"edit":397},{"width":393,"height":394},128,24,"fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZz27fa8jQArT1EJW_tiktok.svg","Zz27fa8jQArT1EJW",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"integrationLogo":399,"integrationDescription":20},{"dimensions":400,"alt":402,"copyright":20,"url":403,"id":404,"edit":405},{"width":401,"height":394},88,"Magento logo","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F1b84a3dc-b92c-402c-962e-7c67064800b3_magento.svg","YvNtdxIAACIAf6KZ",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},{"integrationLogo":407,"integrationDescription":20},{"dimensions":408,"alt":410,"copyright":20,"url":411,"id":412,"edit":413},{"width":409,"height":394},120,"woocommerce logo","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F893beb1f-0cae-4500-bd57-64211ada5190_woocommerce.svg","YvNtAxIAACIAf6B3",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":364},{"integrationLogo":415,"integrationDescription":20},{"dimensions":416,"alt":418,"copyright":20,"url":419,"id":420,"edit":421},{"width":417,"height":394},147,"PrestaShop logo","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd9863cac-b81f-43c3-8b62-6f737bb9e095_prestashop.svg","YvNttBIAACAAf6Oj",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":364},{"title":423,"description":424,"buttonText":20,"buttonUrl":425},"80+ platform integrations","Plug and play with with over 80 platforms, including leading services such as Amazon, Shopify, eBay, Temu, and TikTok Shop",{"link_type":34},"integrations_block$f7226a39-22c5-48d9-be3d-be0a2c8d0ecb","integrations_block",{"variation":429,"version":17,"items":430,"primary":431,"id":463,"slice_type":464,"slice_label":20},"fullWidthBanner",[],{"theme":257,"show_premium_logo":199,"label":20,"label_theme":432,"titleH2":433,"bodyText":434,"image":441,"rightImage":199,"buttonText":449,"buttonLink":450,"buttonDataGtmTrack":20,"primary_button_external":199,"button_secondary":462,"secondary_button_external":199},"Core","Deliver your products with the UK's largest dedicated shipping company",[435,438],{"type":24,"text":436,"spans":437,"direction":27},"Our 20,000+ dedicated local couriers delivered over 800 million parcels in 2024, setting a new record for Evri, and we have no plans to slow down. Our extensive size and scale enable us to be flexible with your volumes, ensuring we can accommodate businesses of any size.",[],{"type":24,"text":439,"spans":440,"direction":27},"Did we mention that we also have some of the latest cut-off times in the industry, all whilst maintaining a 99% on-time Standard Delivery service? Experience unparalleled customer satisfaction with Evri global fulfilment.",[],{"dimensions":442,"alt":445,"copyright":20,"url":446,"id":447,"edit":448},{"width":443,"height":444},7610,5076,"An Evri courier is walking down a street of terraced houses carrying a parcel. The greenery and architecture suggests a rural British town or village.","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x0ZbqstJ9-pVE_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1597.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z69x0ZbqstJ9-pVE",{"x":42,"y":42,"zoom":43,"background":44},"Learn more about our Courier services",{"id":451,"type":452,"tags":453,"lang":455,"slug":456,"first_publication_date":457,"last_publication_date":458,"uid":459,"url":460,"link_type":12,"key":461,"isBroken":199},"ZEaC_hEAACIA6kZm","content-page",[454],"Our Services","en-gb","our-delivery-services","2023-04-26T09:42:07+0000","2026-02-25T17:27:14+0000","our-services","\u002Four-services","38a2e748-e430-4d3a-a030-302c35b360ea",{"link_type":34},"landing_feature_banner$c9c14f0b-5f68-4fb3-8e4b-2d51c8b80202","landing_feature_banner",{"variation":429,"version":17,"items":466,"primary":467,"id":509,"slice_type":464,"slice_label":20},[],{"theme":468,"show_premium_logo":199,"label":20,"label_theme":432,"titleH2":469,"bodyText":470,"image":498,"rightImage":199,"buttonText":505,"buttonLink":506,"buttonDataGtmTrack":20,"primary_button_external":199,"button_secondary":508,"secondary_button_external":199},"neutral","How to get started with Evri fulfilment",[471,474,479,484,488,493],{"type":24,"text":472,"spans":473,"direction":27},"Get your business online seamlessly with our global fulfilment service in just 5 simple steps:",[],{"type":24,"text":475,"spans":476,"direction":27},"Sign Up & Consultation – Fill out an enquiry form and speak to an expert ",[477],{"start":42,"end":478,"type":198},22,{"type":24,"text":480,"spans":481,"direction":27},"Integration & Setup – Connect your store and sync inventory ",[482],{"start":42,"end":483,"type":198},19,{"type":24,"text":485,"spans":486,"direction":27},"Send Your Inventory – Ship products to Evri fulfilment centres",[487],{"start":42,"end":483,"type":198},{"type":24,"text":489,"spans":490,"direction":27},"Go Live – Start processing and fulfilling orders ",[491],{"start":42,"end":492,"type":198},7,{"type":24,"text":494,"spans":495,"direction":27},"Track & Optimise – Monitor performance through the dashboard ",[496],{"start":42,"end":497,"type":198},16,{"dimensions":499,"alt":500,"copyright":20,"url":501,"id":502,"edit":503},{"width":62,"height":63},"A side profile view of a business owner sitting at a desk in their office using their laptop and smiling. Stacked parcel boxes can be seen in the background.","fulfilment-services.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C6%2C7008%2C4660&w=1000&h=665","Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA",{"x":42,"y":504,"zoom":43,"background":44},6,"Get started now",{"link_type":30,"key":507,"url":32},"1957624c-0ab3-4107-a07f-b202e4f0de94",{"link_type":34},"landing_feature_banner$e313c5a4-3a75-4a40-94fd-349dca1ad87b",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":511,"primary":547,"id":549,"slice_type":550,"slice_label":20},[512,518,524,535,541],{"questionTitle":513,"questionBody":514},"What is the process of onboarding with Evri Fulfilment?",[515],{"type":24,"text":516,"spans":517,"direction":27},"You’ll receive step-by-step onboarding support, including platform access, systems training, and integration walkthroughs. Our team helps configure your setup for success. ",[],{"questionTitle":519,"questionBody":520},"How quickly can I go live?",[521],{"type":24,"text":522,"spans":523,"direction":27},"With streamlined processes and rapid deployment capability, sellers typically go live within 2–6 weeks depending on complexity and their internal readiness. ",[],{"questionTitle":525,"questionBody":526},"What are the minimum and maximum product dimensions and weights you can handle?",[527],{"type":24,"text":528,"spans":529,"direction":27},"Our fulfilment centres accommodate a broad range of sizes and weights, but specific limits vary by location. Find out more information about the services we provide in each location here.",[530,534],{"start":531,"end":532,"type":193,"data":533},145,181,{"link_type":30,"url":195,"target":196},{"start":531,"end":532,"type":198},{"questionTitle":536,"questionBody":537},"What are your minimum and maximum order volume thresholds?",[538],{"type":24,"text":539,"spans":540,"direction":27},"We work with startups and enterprises alike. While there are no strict minimums, we are optimised for businesses shipping more than 300 units per week or over 1200 per month, to maximise value and efficiency.",[],{"questionTitle":542,"questionBody":543},"What ongoing support will I receive?",[544],{"type":24,"text":545,"spans":546,"direction":27},"You’ll have a dedicated account manager, support team access via Ticketing function from our platform, and helpful self-serve resources. ",[],{"title":548},"Frequently asked questions","frequently_asked_questions$9ce37c4e-a17b-436d-a5e5-46f37dff7ad4","frequently_asked_questions",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":552,"primary":562,"id":565,"slice_type":566,"slice_label":20},[553,558],{"title":554,"content":20,"pillEnabled":199,"link":555,"dataGtmTrack":20},"Frequently asked questions about Evri fulfilment",{"link_type":30,"key":556,"url":557},"a2d601be-7add-4c72-b6a5-59a5746b9e02","\u002Ffulfilment-faqs",{"title":559,"content":20,"pillEnabled":199,"link":560,"dataGtmTrack":20},"Reach out today to speak to an expert",{"link_type":30,"key":561,"url":32},"b40bbe6e-5e0c-4b10-8bab-4db5537eedb9",{"sectionTitle":563,"sectionDescription":564,"pillEnabled":199,"showPaddingTop":199},"Got more questions about Evri's global fulfilment services?","Find your answers on our dedicated fulfilment FAQ directory or get in touch today.","feature_link_cards$218a870c-41db-4b6b-b687-6ebb9b4019ca","feature_link_cards",[15,49,70,125,181,262,329,352,428,465,510,551],["Reactive",569],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":570,"$sclients":637,"$sglobal-basket-count":20},{"abtasty":571,"accessibe":575,"appPromoBanner":578,"autoDivertUpdates":581,"awin":584,"bulkInternational":587,"bulkSendEnabled":590,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":593,"enableBasketCount":596,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":599,"euCustomsDuty":602,"groovyAdvert":605,"newInternationalSendFlow":608,"newinternationalpages":615,"oohPreferenceFlag":619,"opent